flowchart TD
    A[csdlc-bind request] --> B[Read registered Git worktree topology]
    B --> C[Choose canonical repository topology root]
    C --> D[Scan candidate index metadata]
    D --> E{Issue, branch, or canonical worktree matches?}
    E -- No --> F[Skip unrelated historical record]
    E -- Yes --> G[Load typed record and six cards]
    G --> H[Verify cards and authored artifacts]
    H --> I{Verified relevant owner?}
    I -- Conflict --> J[Typed reconciliation_required]
    I -- Requested issue/idempotent --> K[Continue typed bind]
    H -- Filesystem failure --> L[Typed error with issue and path context]
    F --> M[Continue scan]
    M --> D

    N[Historical #5791 copy\nworktree = .\nmissing local artifacts] --> D
    E -- False match forbidden --> N
